<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans fell in Feb 12 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans fell in Feb 12 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 5</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............795,300 up.....4,100</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......706,300 down...3,300</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......529,400 up.....2,800</p>
<p> ONE WEEK ENDED FEBRUARY 12</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....812,606 down.....115</p>
<p> Financial companies.......627,679 up.....1,670</p>
<p> New York business loans....43,842 down.....356</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......43,606 down.....359</p>
</text>
